<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST9456"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Scbenson2001<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Scbenson2001<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->6-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, February 27, 2005 - 11:31 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I have to say how embarressing is my profile is. I missed by a mile. Yikes!!!<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 9456-->
<!--Post: 9477--><!--Time: 1109537503-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST9477"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Steve_huff<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Steve_huff<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, February 27, 2005 - 12:51 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Y&#39;all, I apologize - I completely missed this thread and started a new one - actually, though, it probably makes a good separate thread. I kind of &#34;graded&#34; my own profile. I nailed a couple of things, but some I just don&#39;t know yet, and others I blew. &#40;Like him being single. Strikeout.&#41; The thread is &#34;My hits and misses, the Huff Profile.&#34; <BR> <BR>I do suggest it&#39;s a good idea, if one isn&#39;t feeling too embarrassed - &#40;I have no pride, so hey, why not flunk myself&#41; - to re-post your profile there and give your own take on how you did. All I really got was his military affiliation, his being a neat freak &#40;article in the Eagle today seems to confirm this&#41;, and his appearance. I do have to say I was so clear on his appearance, and he looks so much like what I thought he would that it <u>is</u> creeping me out a little.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 9477-->
<!--Post: 9674--><!--Time: 1109594275-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST9674"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:rwmm@swbell.net" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Lilymarie<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Lilymarie<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, February 28, 2005 - 4:37 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I thought this was one of the best ideas for a thread on this board. Thanks, Audrey for thinking of it. I really enjoyed it &#34;before&#34; BTK was caught - and enjoy it just as much now.  <BR> <BR>Boy, the monster I had pictured in my profile isn&#39;t the Denny-Boy that is BTK I&#39;m seeing now.  <BR> <BR>Thanks again, Audrey and the others who put themselves out there to post on this one...Lily<!--/Text--></td></tr>
